"body_html":"<div class=\"et_pb_toggle et_pb_module et_pb_accordion_item et_pb_accordion_item_14 et_pb_toggle_open\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_toggle_content clearfix\">\n<p>SPECIFICS:</p>\n<p>Name: Venezuelan Supreme</p>\n<p>Origin: Venezuela</p>\n<p>Region: <span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Santa Cruz de Mora, Mérida </span></p>\n<p><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Variety: 100% Castillo from Finca La Curva.</span></p>\n<p>Altitude: <span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">1,200–1,800m MASL</span></p>\n<p>Process: Washed</p>\n<p>Bag Size: 152 lb.</p>\n<p>Cupping Notes: <span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Complex cup, bright citric acidity, and a long-lasting sweetness. Highly comparable to a premium Colombia Regional</span></p>\n<p><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\"><span>Roasted cacao, vanilla, and rich molasses.</span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
