"id":8664406665,
"title":"Colombian Decaf EA Process",
"handle":"colombian-decaf-ea-process",
"body_html":"<p>Colombian Decaf EA Process - <span>This is a natural spring water – Ethyl Acetate (EA) combined process. This substance is obtained from the sugar cane industry around Palmira, Colombia and no chemicals are added to the beans. </span></p>\n<p><span>Hints of cocoa, with soft, fruity acidity. Balanced, medium body. Refreshing finish reminiscent of cherries.</span></p>\n<p><span>Check our </span><a href=\"https://thetaridgecoffee.com/\" class=\"text-link\" data-mce-href=\"https://thetaridgecoffee.com/\">website</a><span> </span><span>for more info</span></p>",
